{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 2, "text": "发展而更加精致，银饰也随着经济的日益富裕而增多品种，加大数量。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 249, "w": 1206, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "发展而更加精致，银饰也随着经济的日益富裕而增多品种，加大数量。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 249, "w": 1206, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 3, "text": "乾隆以后，布依族妇女的服装开始发生较大变化。独山州一带妇女渐改汉装，易裙", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 310, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "乾隆以后，布依族妇女的服装开始发生较大变化。独山州一带妇女渐改汉装，易裙", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 310, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 4, "text": "为裤。荔波县的方村等十来个寨子“妇女衣着皆尚青，发挽高髻，斜插长髻”①，已不提穿", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 374, "w": 1540, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "为裤。荔波县的方村等十来个寨子“妇女衣着皆尚青，发挽高髻，斜插长髻”①，已不提穿", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 374, "w": 1540, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 5, "text": "裙。都匀、麻哈（今麻江）、平越（今福泉）等地布依族妇女大致也在这时改装。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 443, "w": 1347, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "裙。都匀、麻哈（今麻江）、平越（今福泉）等地布依族妇女大致也在这时改装。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 443, "w": 1347, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 6, "text": "4. 民居建筑", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 510, "w": 217, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "4. 民居建筑", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 510, "w": 217, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 7, "text": "自古以来，布依族就依山傍水而居。村寨多建在山脚的坝子旁边或溪河两岸，住房", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 571, "w": 1459, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "自古以来，布依族就依山傍水而居。村寨多建在山脚的坝子旁边或溪河两岸，住房", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 571, "w": 1459, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 8, "text": "依山建筑，层叠而上。大的村寨上百户，单家独户的很少见，而且多是聚族而居，与其他", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 640, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "依山建筑，层叠而上。大的村寨上百户，单家独户的很少见，而且多是聚族而居，与其他", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 640, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 9, "text": "民族同寨的很少。布依山寨周围，大多种有树木或竹林。地势较低的寨子，周围普遍种", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 696, "w": 1540, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "民族同寨的很少。布依山寨周围，大多种有树木或竹林。地势较低的寨子，周围普遍种", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 696, "w": 1540, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 10, "text": "植芭蕉。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 768, "w": 149, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "植芭蕉。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 768, "w": 149, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 11, "text": "布依族的民居建筑，主要有楼房、吊脚楼、平房三种形式和木结构、木石结构、石板房", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 829, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族的民居建筑，主要有楼房、吊脚楼、平房三种形式和木结构、木石结构、石板房", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 829, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 12, "text": "等。在南、北盘江和红水河一带，常年气温较高，山势斜度较大，建筑以木石结构的楼房", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 893, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "等。在南、北盘江和红水河一带，常年气温较高，山势斜度较大，建筑以木石结构的楼房", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 893, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 13, "text": "为主。这种楼房，夏天通风条件较好。它是在古代“干栏”式建筑的基础上发展起来的。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 954, "w": 1524, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "为主。这种楼房，夏天通风条件较好。它是在古代“干栏”式建筑的基础上发展起来的。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 954, "w": 1524, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 14, "text": "早期“干栏”建筑的结", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1022, "w": 406, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "早期“干栏”建筑的结", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1022, "w": 406, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 15, "text": "构形式极 简单，就是在生", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1086, "w": 490, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "构形式极 简单，就是在生", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1086, "w": 490, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 16, "text": "长着的几棵树木之间距离地", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1151, "w": 490, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "长着的几棵树木之间距离地", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1151, "w": 490, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 17, "text": "面一定高度地方绑上横木，", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1219, "w": 486, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "面一定高度地方绑上横木，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1219, "w": 486, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 18, "text": "横木上搭上木板或木条，顶", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1283, "w": 490, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "横木上搭上木板或木条，顶", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1283, "w": 490, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 19, "text": "上用草或树叶覆盖，底层空", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1344, "w": 486, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "上用草或树叶覆盖，底层空", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1344, "w": 486, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 20, "text": "着，人只住在楼上，一方面力", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1412, "w": 486, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "着，人只住在楼上，一方面力", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1412, "w": 486, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 21, "text": "了避署防潮，另一方面为避", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1481, "w": 486, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "了避署防潮，另一方面为避", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1481, "w": 486, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 22, "text": "免毒蛇猛兽的侵害。唐代", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1545, "w": 486, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "免毒蛇猛兽的侵害。唐代", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1545, "w": 486, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 23, "text": "时，干栏的建筑结构已有所", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1605, "w": 494, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "时，干栏的建筑结构已有所", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1605, "w": 494, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 24, "text": "改善，有了梯子，楼居者可以", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1674, "w": 486, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "改善，有了梯子，楼居者可以", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1674, "w": 486, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 25, "text": "登梯而上。之后，随着农业", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1738, "w": 482, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "登梯而上。之后，随着农业", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1738, "w": 482, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 26, "text": "生产的发展，建筑干栏就设", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1794, "w": 494, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "生产的发展，建筑干栏就设", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1794, "w": 494, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 27, "text": "布依族干栏建筑", "bbox_px": {"x": 1025, "y": 1794, "w": 253, "h": 41}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族干栏建筑", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1025, "y": 1794, "w": 253, "h": 41}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 28, "text": "有放农具和喂养牲畜的地", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1867, "w": 490, "h": 40}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有放农具和喂养牲畜的地", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1867, "w": 490, "h": 40}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 29, "text": "方，到了宋代便把底层围起来，楼上住人，楼下喂养家禽。周去飞《岭外代答》和范成大", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1923, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "方，到了宋代便把底层围起来，楼上住人，楼下喂养家禽。周去飞《岭外代答》和范成大", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1923, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 30, "text": "《桂海虞衡志》都有相同的记载：“编竹苫茅两重，上以自处，下养鸡豕，谓之麻栏。”", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1987, "w": 1431, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "《桂海虞衡志》都有相同的记载：“编竹苫茅两重，上以自处，下养鸡豕，谓之麻栏。”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1987, "w": 1431, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 31, "text": "平房是受汉族文化影响而产生的一种后起的布依族住房建筑形式，始于明代。这种", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 2052, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "平房是受汉族文化影响而产生的一种后起的布依族住房建筑形式，始于明代。这种", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 2052, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 32, "text": "平房，是先在平地打地基上建造起来的。一般为两层三开间，也有五开间的，中间为堂", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 2120, "w": 1540, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "平房，是先在平地打地基上建造起来的。一般为两层三开间，也有五开间的，中间为堂", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 2120, "w": 1540, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 33, "text": "屋，堂屋后为老人卧室或食品贮存室，堂屋外为吞口，有的有吞口楼，有的没有。堂屋两", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 2181, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "屋，堂屋后为老人卧室或食品贮存室，堂屋外为吞口，有的有吞口楼，有的没有。堂屋两", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 2181, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 51, "line_no": 34, "text": "边分别为卧室、客房和厨房，上储存粮食或柴、草等燃料。人口多的人家也有将子女卧室", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2245, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "边分别为卧室、客房和厨房，上储存粮食或柴、草等燃料。人口多的人家也有将子女卧室", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2245, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
